      },
      "tungsten": "dead result capacity returned to a thread-local power-of-two reserve pool",
      "tungsten_native": "native-compiled Tungsten under PROTECT_THE_CORE! and LOCK_THE_DOORS!; arithmetic, bitwise, shift, comparison, sign, power, and conversion rows use ordinary source operators and methods; gcd, lcm, and isqrt call retained C kernel boundaries explicitly with ccall; the prior result stays live until its successor exists and is then released by a timed support seam",
      "tungsten_native_pairing": "each cell runs reps quartets of single-block processes interleaving the native-lane binary (--block) and the C harness (--bench-boxed-block) as native,C,C,native / C,native,native,C with one shared iteration count calibrated from the C lane's paired ns and one native pilot block (the faster lane fills the window, the slower lane's block is capped at 4 windows); tungsten_native_ns = tungsten_ns * exp(median quartet log-ratio), native_pair_iqr = tungsten_ns * (exp(q3) - exp(q1)); blocks carry >= native_pair_min_block_ms of timed work (each is a ~12 ms process spawn) or the C lane's per-cell budget / (4 * reps), whichever is longer"
